{"name": "Tama In-Between", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Slime Cat Action-Puzzle Adventure Featuring Absorb, Split, and Possess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide the mysterious Slime Cat \"Tama\" and solve each stage by mastering the power of Absorb, Split, and Possess. <br/> Every challenge rewards both clever ideas and precise execution, creating an adventure where puzzle-solving and action come together seamlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/fbae0c21866bb6aaefd32a0fa82382a7.poster.avif?t=1793333411\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/fbae0c21866bb6aaefd32a0fa82382a7.webm?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/fbae0c21866bb6aaefd32a0fa82382a7.mp4?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Keys to Victory: Absorb, Split, and Possess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1. Absorb</strong> <br/>Absorb slimes that emerge through each stage, or even reabsorb your own clones. <br/>The larger you body becomes, the more clones you can create\u2014opening up new ways to tackle puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/01667e8b046815a671de1adc675fff8e.poster.avif?t=1793333411\" width=\"200\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/01667e8b046815a671de1adc675fff8e.webm?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/01667e8b046815a671de1adc675fff8e.mp4?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2. Split</strong><br/>Split your body to leave a clone behind.<br/>Place clones on switches, or use the recoil from splitting to launch yourself across wide gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"218\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/b4dd1bc0b057905eccd3e4e2e9b8600b.poster.avif?t=1793333411\" width=\"200\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/b4dd1bc0b057905eccd3e4e2e9b8600b.webm?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/b4dd1bc0b057905eccd3e4e2e9b8600b.mp4?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3. Possess</strong><br/>Send your soul to a distant clone and take control of its body.<br/>Careful clone placement and choosing the right moment to possess them are they key to solving stages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"134\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1a453e3146e8e960ca98c82cfbab281e.poster.avif?t=1793333411\" width=\"200\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1a453e3146e8e960ca98c82cfbab281e.webm?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1a453e3146e8e960ca98c82cfbab281e.mp4?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">All Different Kinds of Gimmicks Await You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every stage introduces unique gimmicks such as gusts of wind, locked doors, player-activated moving or disappearing platforms. Use the three actions wisely to discover the best way to conquer each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/573ceafa64b422785bb017803e89fa78.gif?t=1793333411\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/573ceafa64b422785bb017803e89fa78.poster.avif?t=1793333411\"/></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"168\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/e493861ea5f4481cbf21b8cabee8a9b6.poster.avif?t=1793333411\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/e493861ea5f4481cbf21b8cabee8a9b6.webm?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/e493861ea5f4481cbf21b8cabee8a9b6.mp4?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"168\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/0eb2dff7057d834110e4a711330ed3a8.poster.avif?t=1793333411\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/0eb2dff7057d834110e4a711330ed3a8.webm?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/0eb2dff7057d834110e4a711330ed3a8.mp4?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"168\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1b33425fe1d9f5d0bc0e6ac9b6c016ae.poster.avif?t=1793333411\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1b33425fe1d9f5d0bc0e6ac9b6c016ae.webm?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1b33425fe1d9f5d0bc0e6ac9b6c016ae.mp4?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a world long after humanity has vanished. Life has taken on new forms and continues to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tama, a slime cat, lives a peaceful life with its friends at Kedama House. However, one day, a sinister Hand suddenly appears and abducts all its friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guided by a mysterious butterfly, Tama sets off on a strange adventure to find its missing friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/27b1b768115aff089efefbe20d7d294a.poster.avif?t=1793333411\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/27b1b768115aff089efefbe20d7d294a.webm?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/27b1b768115aff089efefbe20d7d294a.mp4?t=1793333411\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to upload gameplay videos, streams, and screenshots of this game for both commercial and non-commercial purposes.<br/>However, please refrain from using the content for illegal purposes or in a manner that violates public order and morals.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A puzzle platformer where a slime cat absorbs, splits, and possesses to overcome the unique challenges of each stage.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/4cc4026a61121aea958418e27b7b7cc6174f75a7/header.jpg?t=1793333411", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle Platformer", "Puzzle", "Cozy", "Cute", "Cats", "Linear"], "developers": "Masagomi Studio", "publishers": "Masagomi Studio", "release_date": "Oct 29, 2026", "price": "$3.99", "appid": "3769030", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_DAbYSiow7o", "first_seen": 1793228400.0, "review_rank": 5}